# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): abox-mixed-fold-clash's control. E ⊑ B instead.
# Expect: consistent; D ⊑ B.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:B a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class . :E a owl:Class . :r a owl:ObjectProperty .
:D rdfs:subClassOf :E . :E rdfs:subClassOf :B .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual ; :r :b .
:b a owl:NamedIndividual , :B .
:d a owl:NamedIndividual , :D .
